   "title": "START HERE",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# LTX-2.5 - Text to Video\nTwo passes: a half-resolution draft pass (8 steps), then LTX's **learned x2 latent upscaler** and a 3-step refine pass. Picture **and** soundtrack come out of one run.\n\n**Edit only the GREEN nodes.** Everything else is the recipe.\n\n1. Models: pick your files in the four loaders (tier table in the Settings Guide).\n2. (no image - text only)\n3. Write the prompt (one flowing paragraph - see the prompt notes).\n4. Set **Stage-1 width / height** (final output is exactly 2x) and **Frames** (must be 8n+1).\n5. Queue.\n\nSTATUS: structure-validated against ComfyUI 0.37.0; this graph type (two-stage distilled LTX-2.5 + x2 latent upscale, GGUF loader) was render-tested on an RTX 3080 20 GB with 32 GB system RAM. Not tested on smaller cards."
   ],
   "color": "#2a4d6e",
   "bgcolor": "#3a6690"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -460,
    420
   ],
   "size": [
    420,
    470
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Frames & size cheat-sheet",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Frames must be 8n+1\n| seconds @24 fps | Frames |\n|---|---|\n| 3 | 73 |\n| 5 | 121 |\n| 8 | 193 |\n| 10 | 241 |\n| 15 | 361 |\n| 20 | 481 |\n\nAny other number is snapped by the model and the audio length can drift.\n\n## Size (stage 1 -> final)\n| stage 1 | final | note |\n|---|---|---|\n| 352x640 | 704x1280 | 9:16, ~0.9 MP |\n| 416x736 | 832x1472 | 9:16, ~1.2 MP |\n| 640x352 | 1280x704 | 16:9, ~0.9 MP |\n| 736x416 | 1472x832 | 16:9, ~1.2 MP |\n\nStage-1 sides must be multiples of 32."
   ],
   "color": "#2b5d3a",
   "bgcolor": "#3a7a4d"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    1540,
